WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.034 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-This is very exciting.

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.602
I think it's very important
for people to try new things.

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:06.840
Yesterday, first time ever,
you did Bikram Hot Yoga.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, well, I did. I've never
done yoga at all before.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. And you decided to
start with hot yoga.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.682 line:92%
-Here's why. So, I was listening

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:19.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
to this podcast from ESPN,
like a "30 for 30" one.

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-About Bikram Yoga.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it was, like, this --
in the '70s,

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:26.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
it turned to this whole, like,
sex cult and, like,

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.394 size:84% position:42% line:92%
this weird power thing.

00:00:27.394 --> 00:00:29.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"I want to try that."

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:30.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right.
-So...

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
I looked it up, and there was
one right next to the --

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.101 line:92%
in the town right next to me.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.136 line:92%
So I signed up, and I went.

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:39.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when I went, the lady
who teaches the class, I said,

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
