survive."

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:47.280 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.184 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I thought, "Well, clearly
she doesn't know me."

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:56.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you look at me, like,
you think, athlete.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:00.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.194 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-So, I went in there.

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:03.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, turns out,
that was very good advice,

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:04.931 line:92%
the advice that she had for me.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:08.168
-Is this a 60-minute ordeal? 90?
-Oh, no, no. It was 90 minutes.

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:09.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-90 minutes.
Yeah, that's, I mean,

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
