if something is uncomfortable.

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:16.176
-Okay. So, all right. I think
I have to stand to demonstrate.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-But what happened was, so,

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:20.713
