00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And so, for the first

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.486 line:92%
30 minutes, I was doing fine.

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:27.987 size:81% position:41% line:92%
The second 60 minutes,

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:31.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
I, literally, I spent most
