00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.029
-Definitely not sleeping.
-Well, congratulations.

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.197 line:92%
You're here, and you look great.

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:45.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
